v1.0 (2026-07-25)
-----------------
- Rewrite the dashboard in Python with FastAPI and Jinja2, replacing the Sinatra
  application, and keep the URL layout so that existing bookmarks work.
- Remove the bundled jQuery, Bootstrap, DataTables, Ruby runtime, Gemfile and
  Rakefile; Pico.css and Grid.js replace them with no build step or Node.js.
- Read settings from FINANCE_DASHBOARD_ environment variables first and config.yml
  second, replacing .config.yml.
- Enable Basic authentication only when a user name and a password or its SHA-256
  digest are configured, covering the data files as well as the pages.
- Keep the recently viewed codes in a signed session cookie instead of a database,
  and remove config/database.yml.
- Cache each data file by modification time and size, so a file the pipeline
  regenerates is picked up without restarting the service.
- Add etc/finance-dashboard.service, and rewrite deploy.sh to refresh a virtual
  environment and restart the unit instead of deploying the Sinatra tree.
- Add the pytest suite under test/, which builds its own data directory and never
  reads the configured one.
- Add pyproject.toml, doc/LICENSE, doc/COPYING and doc/COPYING.LESSER, declaring
  the dual GPLv3 or LGPLv3 license.

